This demonstrates the new behavior works and did not regress other tests.,Inline documentation of the behavior is present in the implementation comment above normalizeCommentLine in src/rules/helpers/valid-annotation-format-internal.ts:

"This function trims whitespace, strips any inline code spans wrapped in backticks (replacing them with spaces of equal length to preserve character boundaries), keeps any annotation tags that appear later in the line, and supports common JSDoc styles such as leading "*". It detects @story, @req, and @supports tags while preserving the rest of the line for downstream logic."

